# The tax authority's own signing certificates (#674, #951), pinned: a signature in the tax authority's slot of an
# e-invoice (HDon/DSCKS/CQT) counts only from one of these certificates. Licensed CAs issue certificates to any company,
# so neither a chain to a national root nor a name in the subject proves that a certificate is the tax authority's.
#
# Both are issued by the Government CA of Ban Cơ yếu Chính phủ ("CA phục vụ các cơ quan Nhà nước G2"), under its
# "RootCA chuyên dùng Chính phủ G2"; those two CA certificates are in tax-authority-issuers.crt, and
# apps/extract/test/einvoice-trust.test.ts checks that each certificate here was issued by them. Neither CA is a trust
# anchor: only these exact certificates are. How each was obtained, and what is still to confirm, is in README.md.
# Lines starting with # are ignored; each certificate is checked against its SHA-256 line.

# Subject: C=VN, L=Hà Nội, O=BỘ TÀI CHÍNH, CN=TỔNG CỤC THUẾ
